    <strong>Human judgment.<br />Reviewed policy.</strong>
    <p>Accepted outcomes? Reliable execution?<br />Cost justified by the evidence?</p>
  </div>
  <div class="loop-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
  <div class="decision-paths">
    <div><strong>Refine</strong><span>Improve the workflow</span></div>
    <div><strong>Expand</strong><span>Approve more scope</span></div>
    <div><strong>Pause</strong><span>Stop and investigate</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="feedback-path"><span aria-hidden="true">↶</span> Next run follows the reviewed decision</div>
  <figcaption>Decision framework, not automatic optimization. Successful runs alone do not demonstrate value.</figcaption>
</figure>

